<ProjectLayout slug="random-box">
  <p>
    Movement does not necessarily lead somewhere. 
    We run, accelerate, endure, and eventually adapt. 
    Sometimes the body learns to withstand what at first seems unbearable.
  </p>

  <p>
   Information moves differently.
   It spreads, multiplies, and passes through us faster than we can grasp it.
    Still, we keep looking, searching, and reaching for what lies beyond what we already know.
  </p>

  <p>
  Perhaps there is always something that should remain closed. 
  But knowing that only makes us want to open it.
  </p>

